   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Page / Draft / accepted evidence -> source builder -> Block Delivery\nRuns and Results stay with their source. Rebuild before removing old outputs.\nPreserve an unmarked old fragment until its source can reproduce it.\nA move of storage never grants Page acceptance, release, send or submission.",
   "originalText": "Page / Draft / accepted evidence -> source builder -> Block Delivery\nRuns and Results stay with their source. Rebuild before removing old outputs.\nPreserve an unmarked old fragment until its source can reproduce it.\nA move of storage never grants Page acceptance, release, send or submission.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 6,
